# GDExtension adapter

Details: `docs/engineering/gdextension.md`. Contract: TZ §10.

Thin facade: GDScript → protocol → `sim_core`. Pin godot-cpp to **4.7.x**. Build with **this repo’s CMake**, not a second SCons graph.

```cpp
// BAD — GDCLASS is the world
void WorldNode::set_gold(int g) { gold = g; }

// GOOD — translate only
Dictionary SimFacade::submit_move(int32_t dx, int32_t dy);
```

Don't: export `World*`; put trade/spell laws in the adapter; throw gameplay results across the C ABI; register every domain type in ClassDB; include godot-cpp from `src/sim`.
